# Decision records

**Only records with status `Accepted` are binding.** Every other status is history:
read it to see what was already considered, never apply it as a current constraint. A
`Superseded` record is read together with its successor, never alone.

All records for **{{PROJECT_NAME}}** live in this one folder, whichever layer they
concern — the `Scope` column is what narrows them. The format and lifecycle are in
[conventions/decisions.md](../../conventions/decisions.md). With the `tsh-core` plugin
installed, `/tsh-core:managing-decision-records` writes a conforming record and keeps
this index in step.

